SUMMARY:Visible Ink's art and craft sessions
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're wanting a chance to work on your project in a re
 laxed\, collaborative space or learn a new skill\, Visible Ink's art and c
 raft sessions provide an opportunity for young people to hang out\, create
 \, and meet other young artists and crafters. Visible Ink provides a range
  of art and craft supplies to support a variety of interests and our facil
 itator can help you with whatever it is you're working on. If you dont kno
 w where to start\, we can help you to start with activities like sewing\, 
 quilting\, crochet\, knitting and upcycling. Join us on Friday afternoons 
 4pm to 6pm to chill and create!
